[01:20.03] I was only seventeen
[01:22.55] I fell in love with a gypsy queen
[01:25.34] She told me, "Hold on"
[01:34.38] Her father was the leading man
[01:37.03] Said, "You're not welcome on our land"
[01:41.42] And then as a foe, he told me to go
[01:54.84] He took me to a little shack
[01:56.70] And put a whip across my back
